{"seq":3,"slug":"open-problems","title":"开放问题清单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/evidence-applications/open-problems","wordCount":1718,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"开放问题清单\">开放问题清单</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>评估一项前沿技术，比罗列成就更有信息量的是分清它的两类欠账：<strong>工程债</strong>是钱和时间能还上的——更多数据、更大模型、更快推理；<strong>范式税</strong>则是这条路线自身携带、必须靠概念创新才能免除的结构性成本。把两者混为一谈会导致误判：要么低估了追赶的难度，要么把暂时的短板当成了死刑判决。本篇按这个标准整理 JEPA 路线在 2026 年中的主要开放问题，每一条都注明它属于哪类、当前最好的应对是什么。这些问题也解释了为什么本 hub 的每一篇能力介绍都要附带失效边界。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    O[开放问题] --&gt; A[&quot;范式税&quot;]&#10;    O --&gt; B[&quot;工程债&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; A1[长程漂移]&#10;    A --&gt; A2[表征黑箱]&#10;    A --&gt; A3[物理结构缺失]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[动作数据稀缺]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[评测碎片化]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[缩放系数未知]\">flowchart TD\n    O[开放问题] --&gt; A[\"范式税\"]\n    O --&gt; B[\"工程债\"]\n    A --&gt; A1[长程漂移]\n    A --&gt; A2[表征黑箱]\n    A --&gt; A3[物理结构缺失]\n    B --&gt; B1[动作数据稀缺]\n    B --&gt; B2[评测碎片化]\n    B --&gt; B3[缩放系数未知]</pre><h2 id=\"长程漂移-滚动的方差爆炸\">长程漂移：滚动的方差爆炸</h2><p>潜空间规划的软肋在数学上并不神秘。滚动预测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{s}_{t+1} = g_\\phi(\\hat{s}_t, a_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的单步误差记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 步后终态误差近似为各步误差的复合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mo>≲</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msup><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lVert \\hat{s}_T - s_T \\rVert \\lesssim \\sum_{t=0}^{T-1} L^{T-1-t} \\lVert \\epsilon_t \\rVert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≲</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是预测器雅可比的谱范数。只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，误差随步数指数放大；即便 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L \\le 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，偏差项也会让长时程预测系统性偏离真实轨迹。V-JEPA 2 论文承认长时程规划退化正源于此，滚动时域控制用高频重规划把暴露时间压短，但这是绕行而非解决。真正的解法可能需要预测器同时输出不确定度并在滚动中显式膨胀它——论纲里设想的「预测未来及其不确定性」，至今没有以可扩展的形式落地。工程上还有一个容易被忽视的推论：漂移率取决于表征的平滑性，因此换一个更大的编码器有时比改规划算法更能延长可用的规划时域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"表征黑箱-不可直读的代价\">表征黑箱：不可直读的代价</h2><p>联合嵌入路线放弃了像素解码，也就放弃了「看一眼想象画面就知道模型在想什么」的审计通道。表征是否真的编码了物体持久性、因果关系这类结构，只能通过下游探针与闭环行为间接推断——而 <a href=\"../getting-hands-dirty/probing-evaluation\">探针评测方法</a> 一篇会详细说明，探针分数高度依赖读出头的设计，存在系统性的乐观偏差空间。干预式验证（改写内部状态观察输出变化）是从 LLM 可解释性研究借来的正确工具，但在视频表征上做等价实验的工具链还不成熟。黑箱性问题在一切顺利时无感，一旦规划失败，定位原因的成本极高：你无法区分是表征缺了关键信息、还是搜索没找到好动作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动作与本体的泛化边界\">动作与本体的泛化边界</h2><p>V-JEPA 2-AC 用不到 62 小时的 DROID 数据学会了单一本体（Franka 末端）的动作映射，这留下一个巨大的问号：换一台自由度不同的机械臂、换一双灵巧手、或换一个移动底盘，这套映射还有多少剩余价值。跨本体泛化的标准思路是把动作抽象到与本体无关的空间，而 Genie 的潜在动作已经证明从纯视频可以逆推这种抽象——但如何把它变成可控接口而非隐变量，仍是悬案。数据侧的回应正在出现：面向动作条件训练的视频数据集 Action100M（arXiv 2601.10592）试图把交互数据从「小时级」推到「千万级」，规模上去之后泛化边界能推进多少，是未来一两年最值得盯的实证问题之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"物理结构的缺失\">物理结构的缺失</h2><p>直觉物理不是一组相关性，而是一组约束：质量守恒、动量传递、刚体不可穿透。当前的预训练目标对这些约束没有任何显式压力——它们至多作为统计规律被隐式吸收。后果是模型在分布内的物理推理基准（如 IntPhys 2、MVPBench）上可以拿高分，但那些基准本身只覆盖违反事件的有限类型；遇到训练分布外的物理情景，表征没有原则性的理由保持一致。一个尚未成形的研究方向是把守恒律作为正则项加进损失，或在潜空间强制某种哈密顿结构——这类尝试在别处已有先例，但与百万小时级自监督管线的结合还没有人打通。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评测的碎片化\">评测的碎片化</h2><p>对比表在论文之间几乎不可比是这一领域最现实的麻烦。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>常见做法</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>读出头</td>\n<td>linear / attentive / kNN 混用</td>\n<td>分数差几个点可能纯属协议差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微调口径</td>\n<td>frozen 与 full finetune 混报</td>\n<td>归因混乱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基线预算</td>\n<td>各家基线训练数据不同</td>\n<td>论文自认只能系统级比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物理基准</td>\n<td>私有组合、部分未开源</td>\n<td>独立复核困难</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>V-JEPA 2 已经做了示范级的坦白——明确声明与基线的比较是系统级的——但要真正解决需要社区层面的协议固化，类似 NLP 社区当年经历的标准化的过程。<a href=\"../paradigm-comparison/vs-llm-world-models\">LLM 作为世界模型的争论</a> 中提到的「干预优于相关」方法论若成为标配，评测成本会进一步上升，但结论的可信度将完全不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规模化与数据的未知数\">规模化与数据的未知数</h2><p>最后一批问题关乎投入产出曲线。视频 JEPA 的缩放系数目前只有零星实测点（参数从三亿到十亿带来一点五个点的提升之类），既没有形成 LLM 那样的经验定律，也不知道数据缩放的天花板在哪。苹果团队 2025 年的工作（arXiv 2509.24317）用冻结教师重审了训练成本，暗示现有配方的算力效率远非最优——这对「规模化叙事」既是利好也是警告：如果更聪明的配方能用十分之一的算力达到同样效果，单纯堆卡的领先就不构成壁垒。这些动向的产业含义归入 <a href=\"../getting-hands-dirty/research-frontier-2026\">2026 研究前沿观察</a>；工程侧的应对手法（数据管线、掩码策略调优）则散见于 <a href=\"../getting-hands-dirty/open-implementations\">开源实现与复现指南</a> 与 <a href=\"../motivation-mechanism/jepa-family-tree\">JEPA 家族</a> 的配方演进记录。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>长程漂移与表征黑箱属于范式税：前者要靠不确定性建模的概念突破，后者要靠干预式验证工具链；</li>\n<li>动作数据稀缺、评测碎片化属于工程债：Action100M 式的数据扩张与社区协议固化都在正确的方向上；</li>\n<li>缩放系数未定意味着格局未定——效率配方的每一次进步都可能重排名次。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"开放问题清单","id":"开放问题清单"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"长程漂移：滚动的方差爆炸","id":"长程漂移-滚动的方差爆炸"},{"level":2,"text":"表征黑箱：不可直读的代价","id":"表征黑箱-不可直读的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"动作与本体的泛化边界","id":"动作与本体的泛化边界"},{"level":2,"text":"物理结构的缺失","id":"物理结构的缺失"},{"level":2,"text":"评测的碎片化","id":"评测的碎片化"},{"level":2,"text":"规模化与数据的未知数","id":"规模化与数据的未知数"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"用潜空间模型做规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/evidence-applications/planning-with-latent-models"},"next":{"title":"开源实现与复现指南","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/getting-hands-dirty/open-implementations"}}